## Email Configuration

For security reasons, actual SMTP credentials are not hardcoded in the repository. 

To test email notifications:
1. Open `contact.php` (or set environment variables).
2. Update `$smtpUsername` and `$smtpPassword` with valid Gmail SMTP / App Password credentials:
   ```php
   $smtpUsername = 'your-actual-email@gmail.com';
   $smtpPassword = 'your-app-password';
